/-- **Scott 1972, §4.** The inverse-limit compatibility condition
\(j_n(x_{n+1}) = x_n\). -/
def Compatible (x : ∀ n, D n) : Prop := ∀ n, (P n).retr (x (n + 1)) = x n


-- @@ L302-305 verbatim
/-- **Scott 1972, §4.** The inverse limit is the subspace of the product consisting
